name: defaults - reload is 3 (tuned: the shortest value that binds a scan-then-fire loop): fire on beat 1, click on 2 and 3, fire again on 4
rules: default
seed: 1
map: |
  #######
  #A....#
  #######
bots:
  A: script fire E, fire E, fire E, fire E
beats: 4
expect:
  beat 1: Fired A E
  beat 2: Clicked A E
  beat 3: Clicked A E
  beat 4: Fired A E
